Package: qt6-shadertools
Version: @DEB_QTSHADERTOOLS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base
Description: Qt 6 shader tools library for the Xios desktop
 Runtime library behind Qt's shader pipeline. QtQuick materials and effects
 are baked from GLSL into the formats each graphics backend needs, and this
 library carries that machinery for the target device.
 .
 Part of the Qt 6 stack for the KDE Plasma Mobile flavor of the Xios desktop.
